select 'setback', 'Setback (Marginal Distance)', 'The minimum open distance to be left between the building and the plot boundary.', 'Setbacks keep light, ventilation, fire access and privacy between buildings. Front setbacks usually depend on the road width; side and rear setbacks usually depend on building height.', 'On a plot facing a 12 m road, the front marginal distance is measured from the road boundary after any road widening, not from the original plot edge.', 'UDCPR, Maharashtra',
